abstract: >
  Daily scoring of every U.S. balancing authority's own day-ahead demand forecast using the
  public EIA-930 six-month balance files (hourly demand, day-ahead demand forecast, imputation
  flags). Computes MAPE, bias, RMSE and peak-hour error per BA-day, aggregates by month, year and
  named grid event, applies explicit data-quality rules, and publishes rankings and summaries.
